title: POST /repos/:repo/track
tags: [[HTTP endpoint]] [[Tracking a folder]]
kind: reference
audience: dev
summary: Records one path — and its missing parents — with mf_watch = false, and answers its uuid; idempotent.

`{"path": "<absolute path>"}` → `{"uuid": "<32hex>"}`, in one revision. A path already
recorded answers its existing metarecord rather than an error, so a client can track
without checking first. `400` when the path does not exist, lies outside the
repository's root, or is the root itself ([[Path representation]]). `mf track` is its
client ([[Tracking a folder]]).
